<v Dan Savage>我希望你不会。

00:44:53.170 --> 00:45:05.970
<v Judy Savage>Good. Well, I won't. Your private persona is very different than your public persona in many areas of your life.
<v Judy Savage>好的。好吧，我不会。你在生活中许多领域的私人形象与公共形象非常不同。

00:45:05.970 --> 00:45:06.440
<v Dan Savage>Oh, really?
<v Dan Savage>哦，真的吗？

00:45:06.440 --> 00:45:07.170
<v Judy Savage>Uh-huh.
<v Judy Savage>嗯哼。

00:45:07.170 --> 00:45:14.090
<v Dan Savage>Don't ruin me here, Ma. Don't let the cat out of the bag. I've got a sweet gig going. I don't want it ruined by this interview.
<v Dan Savage>妈，别毁了我。别把真相泄露出去。我有一份甜美的工作。我不想让这次采访毁了它。

00:45:14.090 --> 00:45:22.660
<v Judy Savage>What's it worth? No. It's not as raw and crude and uncaring as you sometimes come across in print.
<v Judy Savage>值多少钱？不。你并没有你有时在印刷品中表现出来的那么粗鲁、粗糙和冷漠。

00:45:22.660 --> 00:45:25.570
<v Dan Savage>Mom, I'm hurt.
<v Dan Savage>妈，我受伤害了。

00:45:25.570 --> 00:45:35.160
<v Judy Savage>There, I told on you.
<v Judy Savage>看吧，我告发你了。

00:45:35.160 --> 00:45:59.400
<v Dan Savage>Here's the worst thing of all. Since it's common knowledge now that I'm uncomfortable talking about sex with my family, it's become a game, the best way to tease me when I'm home for a visit. At a wedding last month, word spread through my immediate and extended family that I had interviewed my mom and my sister for this radio show about how uncomfortable I am talking with my family about sex. People thought that was pretty funny, considering what I do for a living.
<v Dan Savage>这是最糟糕的事情。既然现在大家都知道我不喜欢和家人谈论性，这成了一个游戏，是我回家探亲时他们取笑我最好的方式。上个月在婚礼上，消息在我的直系和大家庭中传开，说我采访了妈妈和妹妹来做这个关于我和家人谈论性有多不舒服的广播节目。人们认为那相当有趣，考虑到我是干什么为生的。

00:45:59.400 --> 00:46:45.700
<v Dan Savage>Sensing blood in the water, they came after me. Everybody had a sex question for me that day. Aunts, uncles, nieces, nephews, great aunts, siblings, the happy couple. My aunt wouldn't let me leave her table until I told her what fisting was. My brother told me all about his last one-nighter. And like some reoccurring nightmare, a female cousin, the same age as my sister was that night on the porch cornered me at the bar and asked for oral sex pointers. By the time my 17-year-old cousin, Chris, insisted on showing me his new nipple rings, I was in hell. When I complained to my mother, she told me to stop whining. Then she asked me a sex question herself. I'd tell you what her question was, but Mom took me off the record.
<v Dan Savage>感觉到了血腥味，他们盯上了我。那天每个人都有关于性的问题要问我。阿姨、叔叔、侄女、侄子、姨婆、兄弟姐妹，幸福的一对。我阿姨不让我离开她的桌子，直到我告诉她什么是“拳交”。我哥哥告诉了我他上一次的一夜情。像是一场反复出现的噩梦，一个和我妹妹当年在门廊时年龄一样的女性表亲在吧台堵住我，寻求口交建议。当我17岁的表弟克里斯坚持要给我看他新的乳头环时，我简直在地狱。当我向母亲抱怨时，她让我别再发牢骚了。然后她自己也问了我一个性问题。我会告诉你她的问题是什么，但妈妈把我列为“非正式记录”了。

00:46:45.700 --> 00:46:53.880
<v Ira Glass>Dan Savage in Seattle.
<v Ira Glass>丹·萨维奇在西雅图。

00:46:53.880 --> 00:47:21.320
